    {
      "id": "colorist",
      "name": "The Bold Colorist",
      "description": "Colour is your language. You gravitate towards art that turns up the volume — bold palettes, unexpected combinations, patterns and surfaces that hum with energy. You are drawn to the joyful, the immediate, the unapologetically vibrant. Art, for you, should make a room feel alive the moment you walk in. Your collection is not background decoration; it is the main event — and everyone who visits will feel it.",
